DESCRIPTION:Join us for MCCSC's Steam Night on Tuesday\, October 14th from 6:00pm-7:30pm.  The event will be held at the Academy of Science and Entrepreneurship at 444 S. Patterson Drive.  Participate in coding\, robotics\, drone\, Esports\, and other activities led by K-12 School Clubs\, IU School of Education\, Community Partners and MCCSC's STEM to Them Mobile Lab.  For questions\, please email Dr. Stacy Sedory at ssedory@mccsc.edu - https://files.smartsites.parentsquare.com/3359/steam_night_2025.pdf
LAST-MODIFIED:20260914T020150Z
LOCATION:444 S. Patterson Drive, Bloomington, IN 47401
SUMMARY:MCCSC Steam Night
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
