DESCRIPTION:This will be a panel of college admissions staff from several colleges. Attendees will be able to ask questions regarding admissions requirements and processes\, financial aid\, program offerings\, and more! The following colleges will be represented: Ball State University\, Butler University\, Indiana State University\, Indiana University\, Purdue University\, Ivy Tech Community College\, Vincennes University.\nAdvanced registration is appreciated.  Scan the QR code on the attached flyer to register.  - https://files.smartsites.parentsquare.com/3359/college_planning_101_february_2026.pdf
LAST-MODIFIED:20260914T020150Z
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:College Planning 101
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
